  "cited_article_id": "troubleshoot-lab-interface",
  "reply": "Open Admin > Interfaces > Lab Connectivity, find the vendor and click Diagnostics to run a live ping. If the status is offline, select Action > Restart Service and wait about three minutes for the queue to clear. Only a System Administrator can perform the restart. If the status stays red, confirm your firewall allows outbound traffic on port 443 to the gateway IP. Should the feed still not populate, record the event‑log error code and submit a support ticket with the specimen requisition numbers for the missing labs."
}
